<title>UK: OZ Holding sets further warrants on UBS.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding sets further warrants on UBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>OZ Holding said it has issued a further two million European-style put warrants on UBS bearer shares, bringing the total issue size to four million warrants.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1300 CHF		  ISSUE PRICE  10 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1286 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     - </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
